Package: levelfield
Title: Check That Compared Methods Ran on Equal Footing
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Ahmed", "Eldeeb", email = "a.eldeeb@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for checking a benchmark comparison before reading it.
    Records the arguments each compared method actually passed to the
    functions it called, defaults included; reports the settings that differ
    between methods; audits each method's settings against recorded tuning
    evidence to find methods running away from their own measured best; and
    measures the optimism of choosing a setting on the same data it is scored
    on. Works on benchmark code written as plain functions, without requiring
    a modelling framework.
